{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43206","headline":"奉和夏日游山应制 · 蔡文恭","name":"奉和夏日游山应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"首夏林壑清，薄暮烟霞上。\n连岩耸百仞，绝壑临千丈。\n照灼晚花鲜，潺湲夕流声。\n悠然动睿思，息驾寻真赏。\n掞彼涡川作，怀兹洛滨想。\n窃吹等齐竽，何用承恩奖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡文恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}